* ALPCARRY — ALP proof evaluation via carry propagation (z/Architecture)
* R2 = proof words, R3 = output, R4 = literal count
* Carry is primed (AND identity) so a single full mask still carries.
         CSECT
ALPCARRY AMODE 64
ALPCARRY RMODE ANY
         YREGS
         LGFI  R5,0
         LGFI  R6,0
         LARL  R7,HEADMSK
         LARL  R8,IDWORD
         LGR   R9,R4
         LTR   R9,R9
         BZ    REFUTED
* prime carry: (2^64-1)+(2^64-1) overflows, CC carries, R5 untouched
         LGFI  R1,-1
         ALGR  R1,R1
CHAINLP  ALCG  R5,0(,R2)
         LA    R2,8(,R2)
         BRCT  R9,CHAINLP
* CC 2 or 3: carry out. Mask 12.
         BRC   12,ENTAILED
REFUTED  LGR   R6,R8
         B     STORE
ENTAILED  LG   R6,0(,R7)
STORE    STG   R6,0(,R3)
         STG   R5,8(,R3)
         BR    R14
HEADMSK  DC    XL8'8000000000000000'
IDWORD   DC    XL8'FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF'
         END
